awk
Usage: awk [OPTIONS] [AWK_PROGRAM] [FILE]...

Extract and transform fields from text using patterns.

	-v VAR=VAL	Set variable
	-F SEP		Use SEP as field separator
	-f/-E FILE	Read program from FILE
	-e AWK_PROGRAM

Program basics:
	print X	Print X, or the whole line if X is left out
	$N	Field N of the current line ($1, $2, ...)
	$NF	The last field of the current line
	NR	Line number of the current line
	BEGIN{}	Runs once, before the first line
	END{}	Runs once, after the last line
